  "pulse": "Weekly Product Pulse \u2014 week ending 2026-10-16\n\nTop themes (by volume and severity):\n1. App performance & stability \u2014 159 reviews (avg 2.62\u2605)\n2. Fees & charges \u2014 149 reviews (avg 2.73\u2605)\n3. KYC & onboarding \u2014 120 reviews (avg 2.56\u2605)\n\nUser quotes:\n- \"Orders take a long time to place because the screen keeps loading. I have to restart the app again and again. Please optimise the app performance.\" (2\u2605, 2026-09-23)\n- \"I do not understand why my trade cost much more than the Rs 20 brokerage that is advertised. This makes it hard to plan my trades.\" (3\u2605, 2026-09-22)\n- \"My KYC was rejected without a clear reason. This has delayed my investing plan. Please tell me clearly what is missing.\" (3\u2605, 2026-10-10)\n\nKey observation: Fee/charge complaints are climbing \u2014 from 5/week early on to 19/week at peak \u2014 while 'App performance & stability' remains the largest single theme.\n\nAction ideas:\n1. Run a performance-hardening sprint: fix portfolio/order-screen freezes and chart load times during market hours.\n2. Add a pre-trade charge breakdown (brokerage + statutory charges) on the order screen and link the fee explainer in-app.\n3. Add a KYC status tracker that always shows the exact reason and next step when verification is pending or rejected.",
  "fee_explainer": "Understanding trading charges \u2014 2026-10-18\n\n- Brokerage is Groww's own charge: a flat \u20b920 per executed stock order; mutual fund investments have no brokerage.\n- Stamp duty is a state government charge, applied only on the buy side of a trade and not on the sell side.\n- Exchange transaction charges are levied by NSE/BSE on both buy and sell turnover of every order.\n- SEBI turnover fees are a small statutory charge collected on the total turnover of each trade.\n- GST is charged at 18% on brokerage plus exchange transaction charges and SEBI fees (not on stamp duty).\n- DP (depository) charges apply when shares are sold and delivered from your demat account, typically per scrip per day.\n\nSources:\n- https://groww.in/pricing\n- https://groww.in/help\n\nLast checked: 2026-10-18",
